    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "Find the value of $a$ in the polynomial $ax^3+2x^2+3$ if the remainder is 3 when the polynomial is divided by $x-2$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$a=-1$",
      "worked": "By the remainder theorem, $P(2)=3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}a(2)^3+2(2)^2+3&=3\\\\8a+11&=3\\\\8a&=-8\\\\a&=-1\\end{align*}$$",
